<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Cross-Surface Record Explorer · Starsilk Compendium</title>
<meta name="description" content="Search source-backed Starsilk records across canon, chronology, relationships, media, contradiction, causality, morphology, and research trails.">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url|e }}"><link rel="alternate" type="application/json" href="records.json"><link rel="stylesheet" href="records.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="records-deep.css">
</head>
<body class="record-explorer-shell"><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to records</a>
{% set nav_root = '../' %}{% set nav_current = 'records' %}{% include "_museum_nav.html.j2" %}
<main id="main" class="record-main">
<header class="record-hero"><div class="record-kicker">Evidence-indexed museum navigation</div><h1>Cross-Surface Record Explorer</h1><p>Stable records joined across evidence that already exists. Observed mentions stay mentions. Causality must be sourced. Unknown stays unknown.</p></header>
<section class="record-controls" aria-label="Record search and filters"><label>Search records<input id="recordQuery" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Name, stable ID, type…"></label><label>Record type<select id="recordType"><option value="">All types</option>{% for item in object_types %}<option value="{{ item|e }}">{{ item|e }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></label><div class="record-facets" role="group" aria-label="Evidence presence filters">{% for key,label in facet_labels %}<label><input type="checkbox" data-record-facet="{{ key|e }}"> {{ label|e }}</label>{% endfor %}</div><div class="record-control-foot"><span id="recordStatus" class="record-status" aria-live="polite">Loading records…</span><button id="recordReset" type="button">Reset filters</button></div></section>

<section class="deep-systems" aria-labelledby="deepHeading"><div class="record-kicker">Deep systems</div><h2 id="deepHeading">Canon mechanics, exposed without pretending certainty.</h2><div class="deep-grid">
<article><h3>Contradiction Observatory</h3><div id="contradictionList"></div></article>
<article><h3>Authored Semantic Edges</h3><div id="semanticList"></div></article>
<article><h3>Canon Change History</h3><div id="historyList"></div></article>
<article><h3>Causality Loom</h3><div id="causalityList"></div></article>
</div></section>

<section class="morphology-atlas" aria-labelledby="morphHeading"><div class="record-kicker">Drakken comparative morphology</div><h2 id="morphHeading">Compare what is authored. Leave the rest unknown.</h2><div class="morph-controls"><label>Left strain<select id="morphLeft"></select></label><label>Right strain<select id="morphRight"></select></label></div><div id="morphCompare"></div></section>

<section class="trail-workbench" aria-labelledby="trailHeading"><div class="record-kicker">Portable research trail</div><h2 id="trailHeading">Follow a question through the archive.</h2><label>Research question<input id="trailQuestion" type="text" maxlength="300" placeholder="What are you trying to establish?"></label><div id="trailList"></div><div class="trail-actions"><button id="trailExportJson" type="button">Export JSON</button><button id="trailExportMd" type="button">Export Markdown</button><button id="trailClear" type="button">Clear trail</button></div><p class="record-note">Stored only in this browser. Exports contain stable IDs and evidence references; they do not become canon.</p></section>

<ol class="record-grid" id="recordGrid" aria-label="Stable records"></ol><p id="recordLoadError" hidden>The local record search index could not be loaded.</p>
</main><script src="records.js" defer></script><script src="records-deep.js" defer></script></body></html>